BRXGENM                                                          MAINTC command

Use the BRXGENM command to create the assembler macro libary for the bREXX
interpretor.

The format of the BRXGENM command is:
+----------+------------------------------------------------------------------+
| BRXGENM  |                                                                  |
+----------+------------------------------------------------------------------+

Usage Notes:

1. Set up the proper minidisk search order with the BRXSRCH command before
   using this command.

2. The BRXGENM EXEC creates the following files on the A disk:

   BREXXLIB MACLIB

          Contains the assembler macro files to make up the bREXX interpretor.
